Graphics Draw_Rect Item_Background 0.0 0.0 960.0 540.0 16 20 24 255
Graphics GUI_Begin Item_Menu
Graphics GUI_Text Item_Title "Item Menu"
Graphics GUI_List_Box Item_List Items "Potion|Key|Map" 0 None
Graphics GUI_Button Back_From_Items Back None
Graphics GUI_End

Graphics GUI_Button_Clicked Back_From_Items
Set_Var_Global Back_From_Items_Clicked GUI.Back_From_Items.Clicked
If Var Back_From_Items_Clicked == 1
{
	Set_Var Game_State Bananas/Playing
}

Return
